{
 "name": "net_prologue_struggle_orbs",
 "description": "VUH-2865, PC1 loopback from FM-01 with a host warp to the Day 5 Struggle (02/05 btl84, site tt05-84, Hayner). Shipped defaults: the friend sees and collects the host's orbs (protocol 34, rule A in docs/PROLOGUE_ENCOUNTERS.md). Both seats fight until the host's match ends; the friend must end once, like the host, with worker-hook receipts marshalled to its entity thread. Rehearsal warp, not opening-route evidence. No save.",
 "playerDefaults": true,
 "protect": [],
